# Firoz Mahmud Portfolio — Cursor AI Context

**Before any edit, read `/AGENTS.md` in the repo root** for complete architecture, design system, content rules, and session decisions.

## Non-negotiables

1. **Content source**: `src/data/content.ts` — never invent resume facts
2. **Display role**: Senior Software Engineer (Forward Deployed AI only in `availability` text)
3. **Font**: Inter only
4. **Layout**: use `.page-container` — no nested `px-*` + `max-w-*` stacking
5. **Buttons**: use `src/components/ui/Button.tsx` — glass CSS in `index.css`; nav/tabs use `glassLayers={false}` + `GlassSelectIndicator`
6. **Nav scroll-spy**: use `src/hooks/useActiveSection.ts` — not IntersectionObserver (Skills auto-slide uses IO separately)
7. **Theme**: `localStorage` key `portfolio-theme`; light `#edf1f7` (slate canvas + indigo/teal accents), dark `#2e2e36`; system preference on first visit
8. **Reduced motion**: use `useReducedMotion()` for animations
9. **Lenis**: smooth scroll via `window.__lenis`; BackToTop uses it for scroll-to-top
10. **Cosmic visuals**: distant galaxy in hero 3D only — sections get sparse stars via `CosmicAtmosphere` minimal, no nebula blobs
11. **Commits**: only when user explicitly requests
12. **Production build**: run `npm run build` after code changes so `dist/` stays updated (or keep `npm run build:watch` running)
13. **Section titles**: Title Case for headings; subtitles stay sentence case
14. **AI context**: after structural/UX/command changes, update `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, and this file

## Live page order

Hero → About → Skills → Experience → Projects → Certifications → Education → Contact

Nav (`navLinks`): About · Skills · Experience · Projects · Certifications · Education · Contact

